6. Distribution notes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- The repository contains no credentials, no tokens and no captured runtime
  data. The OpenCode service password is read at runtime from the user's own
  OpenCode installation and never leaves the bridge process.
- The bridge binds to 127.0.0.1 and is read-only. A modified copy that binds to
  a non-loopback address is not covered by the security model described in
  SECURITY.md.
